				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-cc8ef46 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="cc8ef46" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-90df436" data-id="90df436" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0b1c720 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="0b1c720" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h3>Have you considered traveling to Cozumel?</h3><p><a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/island-tours/cozumel-island-ferry-snorkel-beach-jeep/">Cozumel</a> is considered to be to be a sacred sanctuary called “<span style="font-weight: 400;">Cuzaam Luumi, which means land or place of the swallows. It is later shortened to these two words called “Cuzamil”. <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/island-tours/el-cielo-in-cozumel/">Cozumel</a> has a lot of offers it can bring to tourists, you can see top attractions like the San Gervasio Mayan Ruins, Mayan Bee Sanctuary or Chankanaab Beach Park. In this tour you will be able to explore all the beauties of the beautiful island of Cozumel and enjoy fun moments.</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/adventure-tours-1/">adventure</a> will begin by leaving the dock in <a href="https://turismochannel.net/transfers-1/private-transfer-roundtrip-cancun-airport-playa-del-carmen/">Playa del Carmen</a> to move to Cozumel, The staff will transfer you to the Chankanaab Park, located inside the National Marine Park, where in addition to exploring the botanical garden and watching the sea lion show, you will relax on the beach and you will be able to snorkel in the Mexican Caribbean. Then, an all-terrain buggy will be ready to take you to the Punta Sur Ecological Park. You can take panoramic photos here and visit the El Caracol sanctuary, with archaeological remains, as well as the Laguna Colombia, which houses a variety of birds and crocodiles.</span></p><h3><strong>SAILING IN ISLA MUJERES</strong></h3><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you like sailing, you can enjoy <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/island-tours/isla-mujeres-luxury-sailing-in-catamaran/">Isla Mujeres</a> Luxury Sailing in Catamaran where we will explore all the beautiful locations along Cancun’s stunning coastline and take you snorkeling in its warm waters. We will visit the magnificent Isla Mujeres, where you’ll have the opportunity to walk around the town’s prominent locations or explore the island at your leisure. Shopping at local boutiques will also be an option for you and you can taste a variety of foods and cultural cuisine.</span></p><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Relax as you sail across the Caribbean waters under the power of the wind. Our tour guides will begin the journey in Cancun, where we hop aboard a catamaran and set sail to Isla Mujeres. Once we arrive, we will give you the time and opportunity to enjoy and explore various activities. From sightseeing to <a href="https://turismochannel.net/private-excursions-2/tulum-snorkelling-and-cenote/">snorkeling</a>, we will ensure you have the best time of the vacation.</span></p><h3>Snorkeling in El Cielo</h3><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you like snorkeling, you will get the opportunity to snorkel in El Cielo, an island chosen for its beautiful crystalline beaches and its beautiful starfish. You will enjoy a boat ride by visiting the coasts of the Island and admiring its beautiful nature full of vegetation. If you often snorkel, I bet you will have your aquatic camera ready prior to the trip! Explore every corner of the reefs and you will find starfish and multicolored fish that will come to you. In total, you will have 3 places to snorkel and we will provide the snorkel equipment for you. We also give 2 beers per person at the end of the snorkeling tour!</span></p><h3>Isla Contoy</h3><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Isla Contoy is also another island you would want to visit. Isla Contoy is a small island where you can dive into <a href="https://turismochannel.net/private-excursions-2/tulum-snorkelling-and-cenote/">beautiful reefs</a>, which are part of the second-largest coral reef in the world. On the first stop of your Isla Contoy Tour, you’ll be able to snorkel with your guide in the majestic reef. If you’re a nature lover and want to explore <a href="https://turismochannel.net/excursions/nature-tours/">breathtaking landscapes</a>, this is a must-do tour.</span></p><p><strong>What are you waiting for? Pick your destination now and let us begin the journey!</strong></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				</div>
				<footer data-elementor-type="footer" data-elementor-id="5000" class="elementor elementor-5000 elementor-location-footer" data-elementor-post-type="elementor_library">
